WEBVTT

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:23.440
In the end, we detected no
Element power in Mikono Suzushiro.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.108
Yeah...

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:28.737
As planned, we'll send her home.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.488
Yeah...

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:34.993
I think <i>gyudon </i>tastes better with
raw ginger than red pickled ginger.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:36.494
Yeah...

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.499
The tragedy of Aquarion...

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.003
So you've finally decided to join us.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:46.838
I looked it up.

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:52.260
The last sortie by the forbidden
Aquarion was made nine years ago.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.013
The head was Donar Dantes.

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:59.601
What on earth is Aquarion?

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.978
What was the tragedy
that you got dragged into?

00:01:03.104 --> 00:01:08.526
These arms explain things
far better than I could.

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:13.156
--Yesterday's mock battle was interesting, wasn't it?
--Yep, yep.

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.407
It was amazing.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.368
I've never seen anything like that before.

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:20.663
--Yeah.
--It was quite crazy, wasn't it?

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:23.041
I have to say goodbye to Amata.

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:28.755
Amata will become an Element
for Aquarion in this place.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:31.800
Right, just like Cayenne.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.469
He'll live in a different world
from the one I live in.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.847
Oh?

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:40.975
Are you going home... leaving your boyfriend?

00:01:40.975 --> 00:01:44.396
--Boyfriend?
--Amata, was it?

00:01:44.396 --> 00:01:48.149
You two were flirting with each
other like crazy in Aquarion.

00:01:48.149 --> 00:01:49.609
It's not like that.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.695
Did you forgive him?

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:54.155
He was apologizing to
someone in that mock battle.

00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:57.492
The one he was apologizing to was you, right?

00:01:57.492 --> 00:01:59.577
It has nothing to do with you.

00:02:01.413 --> 00:02:03.832
You're always talking like that.

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:07.877
"Nothing to do with." "No way I can do it."
Everything you say is negative.

00:02:08.878 --> 00:02:11.089
Oh, well.

00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:13.758
Here. A farewell handshake.

00:02:18.013 --> 00:02:19.639
Goodbye.

00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:26.354
<i>Reverence!</i>

00:02:26.354 --> 00:02:30.400
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:36.031
<i>I'll hold you over and over and over again</i>

00:02:36.031 --> 00:02:41.870
<i>I'll probably meet you tomorrow</i>

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:47.584
<i>Relying on the dim starlight</i>

00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:53.673
<i>I'll recognize you, I know I will</i>

00:02:53.673 --> 00:03:03.600
<i>After a hundred eons, the two of us</i>
<i>will open the door of legend</i>

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:09.481
<i>Leaping over the blue abyss</i>

00:03:09.481 --> 00:03:15.278
<i>in order to live and die together with you</i>

00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:26.206
<i>I journeyed through many reincarnations</i>
<i>with sadness in my heart</i>

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:29.250
<i>I'm at my full power and yet still incomplete</i>

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:32.128
<i>Being by your side</i>

00:03:32.128 --> 00:03:37.926
<i>brings warmth to my cold heart and with it, pain</i>

00:03:37.926 --> 00:03:40.970
<i>But I'll always be by your side</i>

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:43.848
<i>I'll always stay close to you</i>

00:03:43.848 --> 00:03:48.520
<i>The two of us will board the ship of light</i>

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:54.317
<i>Let's play the wind's opening chords (Awaken!)</i>

00:03:55.944 --> 00:03:59.030
"The Wall ~Conquer Oneself~"

00:04:03.993 --> 00:04:08.373
I wonder if Mikono realized
that I was apologizing.

00:04:08.373 --> 00:04:10.375
Ahhh!

00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:14.170
My hole...! The path of hope is...!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.672
Andy?

00:04:16.673 --> 00:04:18.383
For crying out loud!

00:04:18.383 --> 00:04:21.219
The arrangement of atoms
in this soil has no opening!

00:04:21.219 --> 00:04:24.222
The hole we dug yesterday? It's been filled?

00:04:24.222 --> 00:04:27.892
It wasn't just filled. An Element
power was used to fill it!

00:04:27.892 --> 00:04:29.477
What?

00:04:29.477 --> 00:04:32.397
Whoever filled the hole is on
the other side of the wall...

00:04:32.397 --> 00:04:34.149
...among the female students!

00:04:34.149 --> 00:04:35.150
Female students?

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:39.487
I can feel it. What a stubborn
heart this person has!

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:43.616
But I can tell... that the cute
female student who filled this hole

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:45.910
wants someone to drill her!

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:46.953
Huh?

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:50.999
Just wait, you cute female
student with a nice body!

00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:54.878
So you're not even considering the possibility
that a guy might've filled this hole?

00:05:01.301 --> 00:05:02.427
This music...

00:05:02.427 --> 00:05:03.595
Hm?

00:05:03.595 --> 00:05:06.431
Oh... I bet Shrade is playing it.

00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:07.766
Shrade?

00:05:07.766 --> 00:05:10.935
He's the No. 1 student here
at the St. Angel Academy.

00:05:10.935 --> 00:05:12.896
He's an Element candidate here on scholarship.

00:05:12.896 --> 00:05:16.983
He's exempt from training
and rarely makes a sortie.

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.860
But according to back-channel information,

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:23.531
the girls buy up his photos
the most, by a large margin.

00:05:23.531 --> 00:05:25.158
Hm? Hey!

00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:27.952
Where are you going, Amata?!

00:05:27.952 --> 00:05:29.371
Sorry.

00:05:29.371 --> 00:05:31.706
Hey! Wait up!

00:05:49.307 --> 00:05:51.309
Come in.

00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:53.520
Hey, Shrade. Sorry to interrupt.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.522
No problem, Andy.

00:06:02.987 --> 00:06:04.656
Oh...

00:06:04.656 --> 00:06:09.828
In yesterday's battle sim, the simulator
played some interesting notes...

00:06:09.828 --> 00:06:11.705
So it was you, huh?

00:06:11.705 --> 00:06:14.958
--Er...
--I'm impressed you figured it out.

00:06:16.334 --> 00:06:20.213
The notes were very special,
and very honest, so...

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:24.384
Sounds can express your feelings
even when you don't say a word.

00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:28.346
They can even move people's minds.

00:06:28.346 --> 00:06:31.516
Nice to meet you. I'm Amata Sora.

00:06:31.516 --> 00:06:33.476
I'm Shrade Elan.

00:06:33.476 --> 00:06:35.395
So this is where you were?!

00:06:37.147 --> 00:06:38.690
Cayenne...

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:41.901
It's rare to see you, good friend.
What business do you have with me?

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:45.822
Don't fool around! I have no business with you!

00:06:45.822 --> 00:06:49.075
You bastard! What the hell were
you up to during the battle sim?!

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:51.536
Come with me! I'll straighten
out that rotten nature of yours!

00:06:51.536 --> 00:06:53.621
C-Cayenne...!

00:06:53.621 --> 00:06:57.000
--What're you doing?!
--I don't want you to fight in this room.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.377
I don't like yelling.

00:06:59.377 --> 00:07:00.879
Stop fighting!

00:07:04.049 --> 00:07:05.884
I said stop fighting!

00:07:13.224 --> 00:07:16.519
Sh-Shrade, you bastard!

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:29.199
Goodbye, Amata.

00:07:29.199 --> 00:07:31.659
Goodbye, Cayenne.

00:07:33.244 --> 00:07:35.038
Goodbye...

00:07:36.414 --> 00:07:37.957
Mikono...

00:07:39.876 --> 00:07:42.212
Mikono!

00:07:45.757 --> 00:07:47.592
A-Are you okay?

00:07:47.592 --> 00:07:52.764
Shrade can do some harsh
things while staying cool.

00:07:52.764 --> 00:07:55.433
His Element power...

00:07:55.433 --> 00:07:59.479
He can touch people's minds using sounds.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.441
The strings in your heart are quite disturbed.

00:08:03.441 --> 00:08:05.902
Mikono, was it?

00:08:05.902 --> 00:08:08.488
Are you worried about your sister?

00:08:14.703 --> 00:08:16.037
Now you've done it.

00:08:16.037 --> 00:08:19.374
<i>You </i>started it.

00:08:19.374 --> 00:08:21.126
Perhaps.

00:08:23.545 --> 00:08:26.464
I hear a dissonance. It's close.

00:08:26.464 --> 00:08:28.049
What?

00:08:31.302 --> 00:08:33.722
Abductors have appeared
in the Neo Kowloon Area!

00:08:33.722 --> 00:08:36.099
--Abductors have appeared in the Neo Kowloon Area!
--Neo Kowloon?

00:08:36.099 --> 00:08:39.102
--All are expected to take up Class I Interception Positions!
--That's just a stone's throw from the academy!

00:08:39.102 --> 00:08:41.146
The Elements for the sortie
are Cayenne, Andy and Amata!

00:08:41.146 --> 00:08:42.689
--All right!
--What?!

00:08:42.689 --> 00:08:44.190
--I repeat! The Elements for the sortie
--M-Me too?!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.568
--are Cayenne, Andy and Amata!
--Amata! Battle time!

00:08:46.568 --> 00:08:49.237
--Let's go!
--Hey! Why me?!

00:09:03.043 --> 00:09:05.170
Vector X is now taking off!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.007
Vector Y is now taking off!

00:09:10.592 --> 00:09:12.927
Vector Z is now taking off!

00:09:20.685 --> 00:09:24.397
This time, it's not training.
We're fighting a real enemy.

00:09:24.397 --> 00:09:29.194
I can't understand why you'd put
an amateur into actual battle again!

00:09:29.194 --> 00:09:32.072
Aquarion's power is unknown.

00:09:32.072 --> 00:09:37.243
It looks like Amata's nature brings it out, so...

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:40.663
It appears as if our enemy
will continue to get stronger.

00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:45.877
We need to gain as many
advantages as possible.

00:09:49.714 --> 00:09:51.633
They're not human-shaped...

00:09:51.633 --> 00:09:55.011
They're the usual small fries.
Let's take care of them quickly!

00:09:55.011 --> 00:09:57.222
Go! Aquarion!

00:10:13.446 --> 00:10:16.116
Aquarion Gepart!

00:10:27.794 --> 00:10:29.963
Aquarion's fighting...

00:10:29.963 --> 00:10:33.383
Cayenne... Is it possible
that Amata is fighting, too?!

00:10:36.761 --> 00:10:41.099
I wonder what this uncertain feeling is...
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:10:52.527 --> 00:10:54.237
We've been surrounded?!

00:11:09.127 --> 00:11:12.339
They're strong! When they're
supposed to be unmanned...!

00:11:12.339 --> 00:11:14.674
Their movements are organized.

00:11:14.674 --> 00:11:16.760
They're different from before!

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:19.346
There's a commander somewhere.

00:11:24.642 --> 00:11:27.729
Time for a mysterious show.

00:11:39.074 --> 00:11:41.034
We need to do something, or else...!

00:11:41.034 --> 00:11:44.245
Commander! We have no choice
but to change one of the Elements

00:11:44.245 --> 00:11:45.914
and put in Shrade, our trump card!

00:11:45.914 --> 00:11:48.041
But his body can't...!

00:12:03.515 --> 00:12:05.266
Where is he?!

00:12:05.266 --> 00:12:08.144
Where's the puppet master
who's controlling them?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:14.943
I'll awaken your power... my good friend.

00:12:38.883 --> 00:12:40.385
We've been bound?!

00:12:40.385 --> 00:12:42.846
W-We can't move?!

00:12:46.599 --> 00:12:48.184
What?!

00:12:48.184 --> 00:12:49.728
Piano?

00:12:52.772 --> 00:12:55.150
Shrade, what're you doing?

00:12:58.486 --> 00:13:00.113
This vision...

00:13:14.961 --> 00:13:17.255
There you are!

00:13:24.054 --> 00:13:27.766
Aw, man... they found me.

00:13:27.766 --> 00:13:30.477
But... sorry!

00:13:33.772 --> 00:13:36.399
Our enemy was on the Fated Three Stars!

00:13:36.399 --> 00:13:40.236
Dammit! Even if we want to knock
them down, our attack won't reach that far!

00:13:46.951 --> 00:13:47.952
Hey, they're losing!

00:13:47.952 --> 00:13:49.621
It's dangerous to land!

00:13:49.621 --> 00:13:50.663
Cayenne!

00:13:50.663 --> 00:13:52.165
Sorry!

00:13:53.166 --> 00:13:56.419
--Sorry!
--What's going on?!

00:13:58.004 --> 00:14:00.131
The ship is going back!

00:14:00.131 --> 00:14:05.011
Sorry for setting fate in motion!

00:14:08.765 --> 00:14:10.100
You gotta be kidding me!

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:14.312
So I'm gonna kick the bucket
without merging with girls even once?!

00:14:14.312 --> 00:14:16.439
Andy's spirit level is dropping!

00:14:16.439 --> 00:14:19.317
As it stands, they won't be
able to maintain the Gattai!

00:14:19.317 --> 00:14:21.486
Headmaster! I mean, Commander!

00:14:21.486 --> 00:14:22.821
Please change the Elements!

00:14:22.821 --> 00:14:23.822
I'll go!

00:14:23.822 --> 00:14:27.283
Please switch all the Elements!
Let us girls do the fighting!

00:14:27.283 --> 00:14:28.326
We'll go!

00:14:28.326 --> 00:14:29.828
Commander! Please decide!

00:14:29.828 --> 00:14:31.204
Commander!

00:14:31.204 --> 00:14:32.997
--We'll go!
--Please let us go!

00:14:32.997 --> 00:14:35.750
Headmaster! I mean, Commander!

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:37.794
Element Change!

00:14:41.131 --> 00:14:44.384
Forcibly eject Andy W. Hall!

00:14:44.384 --> 00:14:46.928
We'll send in Mikono Suzushiro!

00:14:46.928 --> 00:14:48.471
What?!

00:14:48.471 --> 00:14:50.306
Who the hell are you?!

00:14:51.307 --> 00:14:52.684
Please wait! I...

00:14:52.684 --> 00:14:56.938
Don't be ridiculous, old man! We have
no reason to be directed by an outsider!

00:15:03.528 --> 00:15:06.406
Wh-What's with this guy dressed like a clown?!

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:15.498
Whoa...! You are...

00:15:15.498 --> 00:15:17.125
...Zen Fudo!

00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:18.626
Fudo?

00:15:19.878 --> 00:15:23.173
I've been waiting for you,
Supreme Commander Fudo!

00:15:23.173 --> 00:15:26.051
S-Supreme Commander?!

00:15:26.051 --> 00:15:29.554
Mikono Suzushiro, go board the Aquarion.

00:15:29.554 --> 00:15:33.099
I can't! There's no way...

00:15:33.099 --> 00:15:34.934
...that I can be an Element!

00:15:36.394 --> 00:15:37.937
Look at that.

00:15:42.859 --> 00:15:44.944
A clumsy man...

00:15:44.944 --> 00:15:48.740
He has only a single means
to protect the ones he loves...

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:52.827
That's right. The only way he
knows is to take the pain himself.

00:15:52.827 --> 00:15:55.246
--What?
--Don't waste your breath!

00:15:55.246 --> 00:15:57.374
Move away from that guy, Mikono!

00:15:57.374 --> 00:16:00.835
Mikono! Make it snappy! We're gonna run!

00:16:00.835 --> 00:16:04.798
I've been protected all this time...

00:16:04.798 --> 00:16:08.426
...by hurting Cayenne and Amata in return...

00:16:08.426 --> 00:16:13.056
It's a lot better... than my heart getting hurt!

00:16:13.056 --> 00:16:17.852
Right now, too... I'm being protected... here...

00:16:19.354 --> 00:16:20.689
Mikono...!

00:16:20.689 --> 00:16:22.232
Mikono!

00:16:24.567 --> 00:16:27.737
I-I can't take it anymore!

00:16:30.949 --> 00:16:32.951
The Gattai has been canceled!

00:16:36.496 --> 00:16:38.039
I'll go!

00:16:38.039 --> 00:16:42.961
Can you do it? When you
call yourself "incapable"?

00:16:42.961 --> 00:16:46.923
It's true... that I can't do anything.

00:16:46.923 --> 00:16:49.676
But... But...

00:16:49.676 --> 00:16:53.972
...I want to hold his hand again!

00:16:53.972 --> 00:16:55.640
That's the spirit!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.142
Okay!

00:17:02.272 --> 00:17:04.649
Element Change!

00:17:14.159 --> 00:17:15.160
Mikono!

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:17.829
Mikono! What're you doing there?!

00:17:17.829 --> 00:17:19.330
Amata! Please merge!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.957
--What?!
--Please!

00:17:20.957 --> 00:17:22.917
I'll forgive you for your head butt!

00:17:22.917 --> 00:17:25.086
What?! Really?!

00:17:25.086 --> 00:17:26.421
Okay!

00:17:26.421 --> 00:17:28.757
Shout, Amata Sora!

00:17:28.757 --> 00:17:33.720
Yukidoke Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:17:40.185 --> 00:17:42.479
Aquarion Evol!

00:17:51.821 --> 00:17:54.824
That's the form they used
when they fought Kagura, huh?

00:17:54.824 --> 00:17:57.035
I've already identified its specs.

00:18:03.208 --> 00:18:06.586
Mikono! Why'd you come aboard Aquarion?!

00:18:06.586 --> 00:18:10.924
I didn't... I didn't want <i>you</i>
to be on the battlefield!

00:18:10.924 --> 00:18:12.509
Cayenne...

00:18:12.509 --> 00:18:17.305
The Despair Prediction that I've seen
over and over since I was a child

00:18:17.305 --> 00:18:21.226
has been showing me... Mikono...

00:18:21.226 --> 00:18:24.062
...that when you get closer to Aquarion...

00:18:24.062 --> 00:18:26.022
...you'll die.

00:18:28.692 --> 00:18:32.570
I wanted to protect you...

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:36.408
Even if you hated me for it...
I wanted to protect you!

00:18:40.078 --> 00:18:45.041
These hands have been
protecting me all this time.

00:18:45.041 --> 00:18:47.252
I thank you for that.

00:18:47.252 --> 00:18:51.756
But I don't want only to be protected.

00:18:51.756 --> 00:18:56.594
I want to protect you too,
Cayenne... my big brother...

00:18:56.594 --> 00:19:00.181
And I want to be hurt like everyone else, too.

00:19:00.181 --> 00:19:01.683
Mikono...!

00:19:05.854 --> 00:19:08.565
Amata...

00:19:08.565 --> 00:19:12.610
Don't do something like that ever again, okay?

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.279
Ah, okay.

00:19:14.279 --> 00:19:19.617
I wonder why... when I'm
with Mikono, I kinda feel like...

00:19:19.617 --> 00:19:22.120
...I can do anything!

00:19:25.457 --> 00:19:29.127
The number on the sync gauge for the
Elements and Aquarion is rapidly increasing!

00:19:29.127 --> 00:19:31.171
--What?!
--What?!

00:19:48.897 --> 00:19:50.398
This is...

00:19:50.398 --> 00:19:52.567
Aquarion's heart is throbbing?!

00:19:56.029 --> 00:19:59.032
Aquarion's fast heartbeat...

00:19:59.032 --> 00:20:01.576
It's the heartbeat of youth.

00:20:03.995 --> 00:20:06.039
What is this...? I feel excited!

00:20:06.039 --> 00:20:08.833
I feel like my heart's about to burst!

00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:13.630
This throbbing... By holding each
other's hands, we connect our hearts!

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:15.006
My heart is throbbing fast!

00:20:15.006 --> 00:20:17.008
Reach to the sky!

00:20:17.008 --> 00:20:18.968
Our feelings are...

00:20:18.968 --> 00:20:20.720
...infinite!

00:20:33.024 --> 00:20:35.402
A-Aquarion's arm is...

00:20:46.913 --> 00:20:48.540
Oh, crap!

00:21:03.847 --> 00:21:08.518
The legendary technique Mugen Punch
is now brought back to life!

00:21:21.072 --> 00:21:25.577
So another seal has been broken, huh, Fudo?

00:21:29.581 --> 00:21:33.585
I never thought that they
had such a crazy technique.

00:21:33.585 --> 00:21:39.424
But, well... I've gotten a ton of
data on them. Izumo should be happy.

00:21:39.424 --> 00:21:40.717
Whoa!

00:21:40.717 --> 00:21:43.803
Just how far does that fist stretch?!

00:21:43.803 --> 00:21:46.723
Ah! It's headed toward us,
Neo-DEAVA Headquarters!

00:21:46.723 --> 00:21:48.558
What?!

00:21:49.726 --> 00:21:51.311
What's that?!

00:21:57.901 --> 00:22:00.320
Th-The Berlin Wall is...

00:22:05.075 --> 00:22:07.035
Ah! It's girls!

00:22:07.035 --> 00:22:09.120
No way... It's boys!

00:22:10.997 --> 00:22:12.540
Silence!

00:22:13.833 --> 00:22:17.003
Now that the wall that separated
the boys and girls has been destroyed,

00:22:17.003 --> 00:22:19.714
I'll tell you one thing!

00:22:21.341 --> 00:22:22.884
"Romance is prohibited!"

00:22:23.301 --> 00:22:26.137
From here on, romance is prohibited!

00:22:26.137 --> 00:22:28.973
"Romance is prohibited!"
What?!

00:22:47.367 --> 00:22:50.662
Good morning... Kagura.

00:22:56.167 --> 00:23:01.631
<i>It wasn't stolen away by the wind</i>

00:23:01.631 --> 00:23:04.509
<i>With the resolve that we cannot turn back,</i>

00:23:04.509 --> 00:23:12.308
<i>we accept the tragedy</i>

00:23:12.308 --> 00:23:17.022
<i>A cavern lies where my heart once was</i>

00:23:17.022 --> 00:23:19.607
<i>If I was older,</i>

00:23:19.607 --> 00:23:25.280
<i>would I have been able</i>
<i>to save you and the future?</i>

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:32.579
<i>Having only a single means</i>
<i>to protect the one you love,</i>

00:23:32.579 --> 00:23:39.419
<i>you become lost and drift in the sky</i>

00:23:39.419 --> 00:23:47.135
<i>I'll never be able to meet anyone</i>
<i>who means more to me than you</i>

00:23:47.135 --> 00:23:53.600
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:53.600 --> 00:24:00.148
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:24:00.148 --> 00:24:06.112
<i>A melody that seals away</i>
<i>the vulnerable tenderness</i>

00:24:06.112 --> 00:24:09.157
<i>The more I play it, the more I sing it...</i>

00:24:09.157 --> 00:24:14.621
<i>It almost destroys me how much...</i>

00:24:14.621 --> 00:24:21.544
<i>...I long for you</i>

00:24:23.546 --> 00:24:27.175
Love bursts out poolside.

00:24:27.175 --> 00:24:30.595
You ran to me with a cocktail in your hand.

00:24:30.595 --> 00:24:32.764
Love reaches its peak in summer!

00:24:33.264 --> 00:24:34.933
"Next Episode 'Romance Prohibition Order'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:34.933 --> 00:24:37.120
"Next Episode 'Romance Prohibition Order'"
"Romance Prohibition Order."
